    "https://chatham.wd12.myworkdayjobs.com/job/Pittsburgh-PA/Assistant-Cross-Country-Coach_JR00000931": {
      "title": "Assistant Cross Country Coach",
      "description": "Start date: 2026-08-04\nPosted: Posted 30+ Days Ago\nPart time\n\nChatham University welcomes your interest in employment opportunities and encourages you to review open positions. Please note that Chatham does not accept unsolicited applications. Assistant Cross Country Coach Chatham University invites applications for the position of Assistant Cross Country Coach . This role supports all aspects of the University’s NCAA Division III Cross Country program, which competes in the Presidents' Athletic Conference (PAC). The Assistant Coach will play an integral role in fostering a positive and competitive student-athlete experience through recruitment, athletic development, leadership cultivation, and program operations. This position requires a commitment to the academic, athletic, and personal success of student-athletes while upholding the values and standards of Chatham University, the NCAA, and the PAC. Duties and Responsibilities:  Assist in planning, organizing, implementing and following up on recruitment.  Assist in coordinating athletic planning, program development and assessment of student-athletes’ performance, retention, personal development and leadership development.  Assist in overseeing program budget and resource management.  Assist in supporting campus endeavors and coordinate athletic events to enhance campus community and school pride.  Assist in ensuring adherence to University, NCAA and PAC regulations and policies.  Qualifications:  Bachelor’s degree.  Excellent leadership skills and outstanding character traits.  Availability on nights/weekends.  Experience competing in cross country at the collegiate level Salary Range:  $12,000 annually/ 20-hour work week. Exact compensation based on candidate skills and experience.  How to Apply:  Applications accepted only via www.chatham.edu/careers  (direct link is https://chatham.wd12.myworkdayjobs.com/ChathamUniversity/job/Pittsburgh-PA/Assistant-Cross-Country-Coach_JR00000931 ) a